@base = http://localhost:3000

### Health
GET {{base}}/health

### List customers (copy an id for the requests below)
GET {{base}}/customers

### Create a work order
POST {{base}}/work-orders
Content-Type: application/json

{ "customerId": "PASTE_CUSTOMER_ID", "jobType": "repair", "formData": { "issue": "Loose jack", "urgency": "rush" } }

### Illegal transition, expect 409
PATCH {{base}}/work-orders/PASTE_WORK_ORDER_ID/status
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "DONE" }